      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Заведите в таблице следующие столбцы:\n\nConcept, Language, Construction,\nGlosses, Morphosyntactic class,\nStructure, LEX Synt, Syntactic coding,\nSemantic roles, Xform, Xrole, Yform,\nYrole, Zform, Zrole, Collocations, Corpus\nexample, Translation",
