      "originalText": "Заведите в таблице следующие столбцы:\n\nConcept, Language, Construction, Glosses, Morphosyntactic class, Structure, LEX Synt, Syntactic coding, Semantic roles, Xform, Xrole, Yform, Yrole, Zform, Zrole, Collocations, Corpus example, Translation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
